"""Loom Brain 閳?FastAPI service on port 3002.

Routes:
  POST /analyze { question, context?, domain_hint?, hands? }
                閳?{ ok, synthesis, hand_artifacts, workflow_decision, cold_start }
  POST /run   { hand_id, task, context, runtime? }  閳? { ok, hand_id, artifact }
  GET  /health                                       閳? { ok, service, hands }
  GET  /resources/:id                                閳? raw connector data (no policy)
  GET  /intent-stream                                閳? intent stream UI page
  GET  /intent-stream/data                           閳? intent events + derived context (JSON)
  GET  /feedback                                     閳? raw feedback events
  POST /feedback                                     閳? append feedback event
  GET  /hand/:id/config                              閳? hand config
  PUT  /hand/:id/config                              閳? write hand config
"""
